OL,3,GNEWSACar hits woman before ploughing
OL,4,Ainto building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been struck by a car which
OL,7,Fthen ploughed into a building in a busy
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FEmergency crews were called to Temple
OL,11,FRow in central Birmingham at about
OL,12,F16:30 BST, with pictures from the scene
OL,13,Fshowing a large white vehicle wedged
OL,14,Finto the front of the former House of
OL,15,FFraser store and surrounded by debris.
OL,17,FThe woman suffered injuries which were
OL,18,Fnot thought to be life-changing, a
OL,19,Fspokesperson for West Midlands Police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
